==Description==
The '''Scarecrow''' was an exclusive [[Enemies|enemy]] that appeared in [[Rotfield]] as part of the [[Solar Eclipse Event]]. It had higher health than every enemy that spawned before it and much faster speed.

==Appearance==
The '''Scarecrow's''' body was entirely made out of straw. It wore a brown shirt and a brown straw hat. It also wore a brown sack on its head, with a wide neon yellow smile. Additionally, its clothes were tied to the body by strings wrapped around it. Its head was slightly tilted downwards as it ran.

==Strategy==
*Cheap towers with high DPS, such as the [[Crook Boss]], [[Swarmer]] or [[Minigunner]] can be quite useful against this.
**Additionally, you can use [[Commander]] and [[DJ Booth]] to boost these towers' firerate and range, respectively.
**Do note that the low cash supply in [[Rotfield]] may limit the potential of these towers.
*You can use slowing towers such as the [[Electroshocker]], [[Toxic Gunner]], [[Frost Blaster]] or [[Freezer]] to slow this down.
*Beginner towers such as the [[Scout]] or [[Soldier]] can be used to kill these.
**They can be even more useful with their {{Color|Golden}} skins equipped.

